# Whitelist: only the engine, its tests and the shipped example project are tracked. Run output (state/, logs, sessions),
# local/ (machine.json, budget, manifest) and the .bak* / .pre-* hand backups stay local. The owner's projects and tools live
# in their own repo (META-ONBOARD S6), never here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/engine/
!/projects/
/projects/*
!/projects/example/
!/tests/
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/SETUP.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/PRODUCT.md
!/DESIGN.md
!/LICENSE
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/img/
